  "gate": "All 27 no-ranking 4,000-iteration preflights complete before cold count preparation or any independent ranking. Cold full 8x8 counts match both the pinned PR131 physical report and independent ordered-board numeric-rule replay. Every case has three timed remap+provenance+prepared-solve+complete-wrapper-JSON calls, independent physical count/policy replay, exact work-budget parity, and zero warm rank calls. Each full 8x8 global-image result, after inverse mapping board and hand labels and removing only equity_preparation, must reproduce the pinned PR131 complete policy payload hash. Target is independent NashConv plus 1e-9 <= 0.005 chips. Misses and expected resource rejections are preserved; there is no fallback.",
  "model_limits": "Heads-up fixed flop, finite flop betting and forced hidden turn/river checkdown. Suit remaps transfer only exact 4-suit global images of a source board plus ordered OOP/IP private pair. No later-street betting, preflop solving, rake, multiway play or unrestricted NLHE.",
  "provenance_note": "Independently developed exact suit-image benchmark. Production remap provenance is checked by separately applied 4-suit maps and a locally spelled 52-card deck bijection, including each source/target 45-card remaining deck. Independent best-five numeric-rule policy replay is the accuracy oracle. No external code or dependencies are used."
